    "One bounded same-job ABBA on one hosted Windows VM is descriptive evidence, not a replacement production acceptance run or an adoption decision.",
    "The Windows job passed. The overall workflow failed in the separate macOS job; no macOS raw sample is included in this audit.",
    "Per-route A/B direction is the mean of A1/A4 run quantiles compared with the mean of B2/B3 run quantiles. This is not a pooled p99, confidence interval, or statistical-significance test.",
